================================================================================
1. PREAMBLE & PRINCIPLES
================================================================================
Rezonator is a deterministic, mathematical code intelligence engine for legacy
mainframe systems. This license is structured to encourage scientific research,
academic peer review, and non-commercial evaluation, while strictly requiring
commercial entities (including banks, financial institutions, and enterprise
consultancies) to acquire a commercial license, and providing a dedicated
royalty-free waiver for public, life-saving healthcare infrastructure.

================================================================================
2. PERMITTED FREE USES (NON-COMMERCIAL & EVALUATION)
================================================================================
Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any individual or academic
institution to obtain a copy of this software and associated documentation files
(the "Software"), to inspect, compile, run, test, and evaluate the Software
subject to the following conditions:

a. Non-Commercial Use: The Software may be used freely for personal evaluation,
   academic study, scientific research, and non-profit educational purposes.
b. Security Audit & Peer Review: The Software may be audited and evaluated for
   scientific reproducibility, cryptographic provenance, and security analysis.
c. Retention of Notices: All copies or substantial portions of the Software
   must retain the above copyright notice, this license agreement, and the
   disclaimer of warranty.

